<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδή</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>human voice,
			speech</i> (but distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.44
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλιτος γλυκίων ῥέεν αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.249
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>sound</i> or <i>twang</i> of the bow-string, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὸν ἄεισε χελιδόνι εἰκέλη αὐδήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.411
				</span></i>
			; of a trumpet, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				989
			</span></i>; of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέττιξ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				396
			</span></i>; of the <i>sound</i> emitted by the statue of Memnon, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				990.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Balbilla</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>report, account,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργων ἀΐοντες αὐδήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					240
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				600
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				567
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>oracle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				976
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>song, ode,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				9.4
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>vadati</i> 'speaks', 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείδω.</span>
			)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
